### Login
# @name login
POST {{ODDS_FEED_URL}}/api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "operatorId": "{{OPERATOR_ID}}",
    "password": "{{OPERATOR_PASSWORD}}"
}

### Get Schedule
# @name schedule
GET {{ODDS_FEED_URL}}/api/schedule
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Get event

GET {{ODDS_FEED_URL}}/api/events?eventID={{EVENT_ID}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json
